<h1>About Nigeria Money Guide</h1>
<p><b>Founded: 2025 | Based in: Abuja, Nigeria</b></p>

<h2>Who We Are</h2>
<p>Nigeria Money Guide is Nigeria's leading independent platform for comparing financial products. We help over 500,000 Nigerians every month make smart decisions about loans, banks, and saving money.</p>
<p>Our mission is simple: <b>To provide honest, accurate, and easy-to-understand financial information</b> so every Nigerian can access credit safely and avoid loan sharks.</p>

<h2>Our Team</h2>
<p><b>Yusuf Yahaya - Lead Financial Analyst</b><br>
Certified Financial Analyst with 5+ years experience reviewing loan apps, banks, and fintech products in Nigeria. All content is reviewed by Yusuf before publishing.</p>

<p><b>Nigeria Money Guide Research Team</b><br>
We test every loan app ourselves. We apply, borrow, and repay to check speed, hidden fees, and customer service. We update our data every month.</p>

<h2>Our Commitment to You</h2>
<ol>
<li><b>Honest Reviews:</b> We are not owned by any loan app. We tell you the pros AND cons.</li>
<li><b>Up-to-Date Data:</b> Interest rates and loan limits change. We verify every 30 days.</li>
<li><b>CBN Compliance:</b> We only recommend loan apps licensed by Central Bank of Nigeria.</li>
</ol>

